# Statusly environment variables (Doc 02 — TRD).
# Copy to `.env` and fill in real values. `.env` is gitignored — never commit secrets.
# In dev, AdMob uses Google's official TEST unit IDs regardless of these (see src/features/ads).

# AdMob — real IDs are only wired at build time (Phase 9).
ADMOB_ANDROID_APP_ID=
ADMOB_BANNER_UNIT_ID=
ADMOB_INTERSTITIAL_UNIT_ID=
ADMOB_APPOPEN_UNIT_ID=
ADMOB_NATIVE_UNIT_ID=

# IAP
IAP_REMOVE_ADS_SKU=remove_ads

# Crash reporting (Phase 1 wiring is no-op until this is set)
SENTRY_DSN=


## Google Play Review Readiness

Before considering the app complete, verify:

✔ No crashes
✔ No console errors
✔ No TypeScript errors
✔ No ESLint errors
✔ No build warnings that affect production
✔ Release build succeeds
✔ App Bundle (.aab) builds successfully
✔ All screens function correctly
✔ All buttons work
✔ All permissions are justified
✔ Privacy policy requirements are identified
✔ Data Safety requirements are documented
✔ Target audience implications are considered
✔ Ads declaration implications are identified
✔ Store listing assets required are listed


also check 

Final Deliverable

The finished project should be:

Production-ready
Secure
Optimized
Maintainable
Fully typed
Policy compliant
Easy to extend
Ready for Google Play submission